1
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:44,520
<i>Today is September 30.</i>

2
00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:47,000
<i>This is the first email</i>
<i>I've written to you.</i>

3
00:01:47,080 --> 00:01:49,240
<i>I'm sending it later than I expected.</i>

4
00:01:50,600 --> 00:01:53,440
<i>I've rented an apartment</i>
<i>near the research institute.</i>

5
00:01:53,520 --> 00:01:55,320
<i>Lately, I've discovered what it's like</i>

6
00:01:55,400 --> 00:01:58,400
<i>to carry everything you own on your back.</i>

7
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:01,600
<i>It made me think of you.</i>

8
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:07,200
<i>I often walk to the institute.</i>

9
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:09,160
<i>- The streets are beautiful.</i>
- Morning.

10
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:11,680
<i>I've noticed an interesting habit</i>
<i>among Germans.</i>

11
00:02:11,760 --> 00:02:12,960
<i>When you're</i>
<i>walking outside,</i>

12
00:02:13,040 --> 00:02:14,480
<i>if you make eye contact</i>
<i>with someone,</i>

13
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:17,120
<i>they'll greet you with</i>
<i>"Good morning."</i>

14
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:23,280
<i>I met up with a friend</i>
<i>on the weekend.</i>

15
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:24,880
<i>His name is Qin Sizhi.</i>

16
00:02:25,440 --> 00:02:28,800
<i>Before the accident,</i>
<i>he was my best friend at school.</i>

17
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:33,720
<i>Afterward, as you know,</i>
<i>I distanced myself from everyone,</i>

18
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:36,880
<i>even my former self.</i>

19
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:40,840
<i>Seeing him again</i>
<i>made me realize</i>

20
00:02:40,920 --> 00:02:43,240
<i>that reconnecting</i>
<i>isn't that hard.</i>

21
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:48,480
<i>Even though my colleagues</i>
<i>speak English at work,</i>

22
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:51,400
<i>I've started learning German anyway.</i>

23
00:02:51,480 --> 00:02:53,120
<i>The pronunciation is difficult.</i>

24
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:55,440
<i>It feels like something's</i>
<i>stuck in my throat.</i>

25
00:02:57,080 --> 00:02:59,360
<i>An Italian at the institute told me</i>

26
00:02:59,440 --> 00:03:02,320
<i>that learning a new language is like</i>
<i>learning to speak all over again.</i>

27
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,160
<i>He was right.</i>

28
00:03:04,880 --> 00:03:06,520
I MISS YOU

29
00:03:06,600 --> 00:03:10,640
<i>Ich vermisse dich.</i>

30
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:15,600
<i>What about Qingyi?</i>

31
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:16,880
<i>Has it started getting colder?</i>

32
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:21,120
<i>It got colder for a bit,</i>

33
00:03:21,200 --> 00:03:24,160
<i>but the temperature soon climbed</i>
<i>back up into the twenties again.</i>

34
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:28,120
<i>My life isn't as eventful</i>
<i>as the weather.</i>

35
00:03:28,200 --> 00:03:29,960
<i>Each day,</i>
<i>I just go back and forth</i>

36
00:03:30,040 --> 00:03:32,920
<i>between my internship,</i>
<i>the lab, and my dorm.</i>

37
00:03:33,920 --> 00:03:36,320
<i>But I feel a sense of peace</i>
<i>despite all the business.</i>

38
00:03:38,440 --> 00:03:39,960
<i>On my way back</i>
<i>to the university,</i>

39
00:03:40,040 --> 00:03:41,680
<i>I got caught</i>
<i>in a sun-shower.</i>

40
00:03:41,760 --> 00:03:44,120
<i>My roommate said</i>
<i>my bangs were dripping wet,</i>

41
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:45,680
<i>and I looked like a bedraggled cat.</i>

42
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:49,840
<i>But I like sun-showers</i>

43
00:03:49,920 --> 00:03:54,720
<i>because I know they mean</i>
<i>the rain will soon be over,</i>

44
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:57,000
<i>and there's a good chance</i>
<i>a rainbow will appear.</i>

45
00:03:59,160 --> 00:04:02,160
<i>Bi Dezheng's catchphrase</i>
<i>these days is…</i>

46
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:05,520
If only Chen Yanzhou
were here.

47
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:09,080
<i>He still resents you</i>
<i>for going abroad.</i>

48
00:04:09,160 --> 00:04:11,200
<i>But every time</i>
<i>he says that,</i>

49
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:13,320
<i>he puts his head down</i>
<i>and gets the work done.</i>

50
00:04:14,040 --> 00:04:15,800
<i>I think he'll graduate just fine.</i>

51
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:21,519
<i>Oh, right.</i>
<i>I have good news.</i>

52
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:24,040
<i>The potted plant you gave me</i>
<i>has bloomed again.</i>

53
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:27,520
<i>This might be</i>
<i>its last flowering season.</i>

54
00:04:28,520 --> 00:04:29,720
<i>I'll take good care of it.</i>

55
00:04:31,520 --> 00:04:33,080
<i>After reading your email,</i>

56
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:35,640
<i>I bought a potted plant too</i>
<i>and put it in my apartment.</i>

57
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:37,920
<i>But winter is coming.</i>

58
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:39,960
<i>I don't know how long</i>
<i>it'll survive,</i>

59
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:42,880
<i>especially with</i>
<i>so little sunlight here.</i>

60
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:46,480
<i>The leaves in the nearby park</i>
<i>have already turned yellow.</i>

61
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:48,600
<i>One day, as I was passing by,</i>

62
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:51,120
<i>a leaf fell onto my shoulder.</i>

63
00:04:51,200 --> 00:04:55,000
<i>It reminded me of that time</i>
<i>we did light trapping.</i>

64
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:56,320
<i>A butterfly</i>

65
00:04:56,400 --> 00:04:57,800
<i>once landed</i>
<i>on your shoulder.</i>

66
00:04:59,160 --> 00:05:02,600
<i>A German colleague saw</i>
<i>the leaf I kept in my book</i>

67
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:04,200
<i>and called me romantic.</i>

68
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:08,640
<i>But I really just wanted</i>
<i>to share it with you.</i>

69
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:10,640
<i>That's why I kept it.</i>

70
00:05:11,400 --> 00:05:14,960
<i>Maybe the act of sharing</i>
<i>is romantic in itself.</i>

71
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:20,160
<i>I bought a cake from a bakery today.</i>

72
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:22,720
<i>The old lady running the shop</i>
<i>asked me to write something on it.</i>

73
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:25,200
<i>I remembered what you said</i>
<i>about sun-showers,</i>

74
00:05:25,280 --> 00:05:28,920
<i>so I wrote,</i>
<i>"The sun is shining, but it's raining."</i>

75
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:30,640
<i>Is my German getting better?</i>

76
00:05:33,280 --> 00:05:36,040
<i>I've been spending more and more time</i>
<i>at the institute lately.</i>

77
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:38,280
<i>The data came out wrong several times,</i>

78
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:42,560
<i>but my German lecturer told me</i>
<i>that failure was data too.</i>

79
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:46,000
<i>I took those words to heart</i>
<i>and went back to working overtime.</i>

80
00:05:46,080 --> 00:05:48,320
<i>On my way home, I realized it was snowing.</i>

81
00:05:48,400 --> 00:05:50,280
<i>After walking for ten minutes,</i>

82
00:05:50,360 --> 00:05:52,040
<i>my ears were aching from the cold.</i>

83
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:55,000
<i>It must be cold in Qingyi by now too.</i>

84
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:56,480
<i>Remember to rug up.</i>

85
00:05:57,880 --> 00:05:59,400
<i>During my lunch break,</i>

86
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:02,320
<i>I sneak off alone to eat lunch</i>
<i>in a park near the company.</i>

87
00:06:03,840 --> 00:06:08,400
<i>I used to think I only ate to stay alive,</i>

88
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:10,600
<i>so anything would do.</i>

89
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:11,640
<i>No need to waste money.</i>

90
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:18,080
<i>But now, it's like</i>
<i>my taste buds have awakened.</i>

91
00:06:20,640 --> 00:06:22,320
<i>Is there any good food in Germany?</i>

92
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:24,920
<i>It can't just be hot chocolate, right?</i>

93
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:27,440
<i>Oh, right.</i>

94
00:06:27,520 --> 00:06:30,280
<i>I transferred some money to your account.</i>

95
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:31,480
<i>Make sure you check it.</i>

96
00:06:36,520 --> 00:06:39,400
<i>This winter break, my roommates</i>
<i>didn't go home right away.</i>

97
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:41,880
<i>Linlin is preparing for grad school exams,</i>

98
00:06:42,440 --> 00:06:44,040
<i>and Zhuang Ning has started an internship.</i>

99
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:47,840
<i>As for Fangli,</i>

100
00:06:48,480 --> 00:06:49,760
<i>she's in a relationship now.</i>

101
00:06:49,840 --> 00:06:51,520
<i>Apparently, he's her childhood sweetheart.</i>

102
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:52,960
Song Mo!

103
00:07:04,120 --> 00:07:07,760
<i>As for me, guess who I'm spending</i>
<i>Lunar New Year with this year?</i>

104
00:07:07,840 --> 00:07:09,560
You just set off all those fireworks.

105
00:07:09,640 --> 00:07:10,880
I'm saving these for my sister.

106
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:13,120
Ms. Zheng said I could play with them all.

107
00:07:13,200 --> 00:07:14,880
She was just being polite.

108
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:15,920
No, she wasn't!

109
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:17,160
You're so stingy!

110
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:19,560
If Yanzhou were here,
you wouldn't dare treat me like this.

111
00:07:19,640 --> 00:07:20,920
Why wouldn't I dare?

112
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:23,640
If he were here, you wouldn't get
to play with any of these.

113
00:07:23,720 --> 00:07:24,880
They'd all go to my sister.

114
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:26,640
You're lying.

115
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:29,800
- Give them to me!
- No!

116
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:31,960
- Give them to me!
- No!

117
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:33,560
- Give me some!
- Give me some!

118
00:07:33,640 --> 00:07:34,720
I'll light them for you.

119
00:07:38,520 --> 00:07:39,520
Here.

120
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:43,920
<i>Chen Yanzhou.</i>

121
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:45,520
<i>Happy Lunar New Year.</i>

122
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:55,080
<i>Regarding the good food</i>
<i>that you asked about last time,</i>

123
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:57,400
<i>I've found a new answer this spring.</i>

124
00:07:58,400 --> 00:08:00,560
<i>I can finally eat eggs again.</i>

125
00:08:00,640 --> 00:08:03,040
<i>Maybe this means</i>
<i>I've fully recovered.</i>

126
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:07,720
<i>A professor at the institute</i>
<i>found out I was learning German,</i>

127
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:09,600
<i>so he gave me a prompt.</i>

128
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:12,720
<i>I thought about it for a week</i>
<i>and eventually wrote,</i>

129
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:17,600
<i>"I don't long for distant places,</i>
<i>because I'm already far from home."</i>

130
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:22,160
<i>"But there's one person</i>
<i>I feel homesick for."</i>

131
00:08:22,960 --> 00:08:24,120
<i>Zheng Yu.</i>

132
00:08:24,200 --> 00:08:26,160
<i>Summer is coming again.</i>

133
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:27,920
<i>You've worked</i>
<i>so hard for so long.</i>

134
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:29,960
<i>Have you given yourself</i>
<i>a break?</i>

135
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:31,640
<i>I haven't gone on vacation.</i>

136
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:32,640
PAYEE NAME: WU FA

137
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:35,880
<i>But I did something that</i>
<i>made me even happier.</i>

138
00:08:35,960 --> 00:08:37,720
<i>I paid off</i>
<i>the last of my debt.</i>

139
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:43,400
<i>And there's more good news.</i>

140
00:08:44,159 --> 00:08:47,800
Zheng Yu! Have you checked
our paper's submission status?

141
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:49,840
Our paper got accepted!

142
00:08:50,760 --> 00:08:52,400
- Really?
- Yes!

143
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:55,120
See for yourself.

144
00:09:00,680 --> 00:09:04,880
Should we tell Chen Yanzhou?

145
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:06,760
After all, he put
a lot of work into this too.

146
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:08,200
Of course!

147
00:09:08,800 --> 00:09:11,800
I'll leave it to you to let him know.

148
00:09:13,680 --> 00:09:14,600
No problem.

149
00:09:16,200 --> 00:09:18,080
There's a job fair
at the cafeteria this afternoon.

150
00:09:18,160 --> 00:09:19,560
Do you want to check it out together?

151
00:09:19,640 --> 00:09:21,280
It's the last job fair before we graduate.

152
00:09:22,640 --> 00:09:24,200
I think I'll pass.

153
00:09:26,520 --> 00:09:28,160
You are

154
00:09:29,760 --> 00:09:31,600
not studying for
the grad school entrance exams,

155
00:09:31,680 --> 00:09:33,800
and you're skipping campus recruitment.

156
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:36,480
Zheng Yu.

157
00:09:38,040 --> 00:09:40,480
You're not

158
00:09:41,280 --> 00:09:43,280
planning on giving up on
everything, are you?

159
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:46,200
No.

160
00:09:46,280 --> 00:09:47,200
Just wait a bit longer.

161
00:09:47,280 --> 00:09:49,680
Once everything is settled, I'll tell you.

162
00:09:51,680 --> 00:09:52,600
<i>As for Xiaomian…</i>

163
00:09:52,680 --> 00:09:53,600
Okay.

164
00:09:53,680 --> 00:09:55,120
<i>His College Entrance Exam is coming up.</i>

165
00:09:56,040 --> 00:09:58,240
<i>He says he wants to attend</i>
<i>Ji An University.</i>

166
00:09:58,320 --> 00:10:01,800
<i>It's only a 40-minute</i>
<i>high-speed train ride from Qingyi.</i>

167
00:10:01,880 --> 00:10:05,400
<i>I guess he doesn't want to stay in Qingyi</i>
<i>because of Jiang Haixing.</i>

168
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:08,960
<i>As for why he didn't choose</i>
<i>somewhere farther away…</i>

169
00:10:09,040 --> 00:10:11,120
<i>Well… that I don't know.</i>

170
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:12,320
Jiang Mian!

171
00:10:14,560 --> 00:10:16,800
- Aren't you sophomores already on break?
- That's right.

172
00:10:16,880 --> 00:10:18,600
They need the classrooms for your exams.

173
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:20,360
Then why are you…?

174
00:10:21,680 --> 00:10:23,560
I came to give you something.

175
00:10:27,680 --> 00:10:28,680
What is this?

176
00:10:29,480 --> 00:10:30,440
It's a lucky charm.

177
00:10:30,520 --> 00:10:33,200
They're really popular now.
You didn't know?

178
00:10:35,880 --> 00:10:39,680
Well, I guess top students like you
don't pay attention to these things.

179
00:10:40,520 --> 00:10:42,920
Anyway, just think of it as
a good-luck charm.

180
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:44,120
Keep it.

181
00:10:45,320 --> 00:10:47,960
And listen, you'd better get a high score.

182
00:10:48,040 --> 00:10:50,880
Otherwise, it'll be so embarrassing for me
after all the tutoring you gave me.

183
00:10:53,120 --> 00:10:54,960
Okay, I should get going.

184
00:10:55,040 --> 00:10:56,080
Good luck!

185
00:11:05,360 --> 00:11:06,200
Good luck!

186
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:19,600
<i>When I saw your email, I was in the lab.</i>

187
00:11:19,680 --> 00:11:22,280
<i>I was so excited,</i>
<i>I almost messed up a data point.</i>

188
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:25,360
<i>I know it's a bit late,</i>
<i>but congratulations!</i>

189
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:28,160
<i>I can't believe Xiaomian is about to take</i>
<i>the College Entrance Exam.</i>

190
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:29,760
<i>Time really flies.</i>

191
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:31,920
<i>You'll be graduating soon too.</i>

192
00:11:32,640 --> 00:11:35,520
<i>Do you have any plans?</i>

193
00:11:35,600 --> 00:11:37,040
<i>I do have a plan,</i>

194
00:11:37,680 --> 00:11:40,240
<i>and I've been preparing for it</i>
<i>for a while now.</i>

195
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:41,160
<i>But…</i>

196
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:42,400
Ms. Yang.

197
00:11:43,880 --> 00:11:47,200
Every time you come to see me,
you look so much thinner than before.

198
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:51,640
But regardless,
the debt is fully paid off now,

199
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:53,360
which is a huge weight off your shoulders.

200
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:56,440
What about the other matter?

201
00:11:57,840 --> 00:12:00,240
Look, every time I see you,

202
00:12:01,120 --> 00:12:02,160
you're always…

203
00:12:02,240 --> 00:12:03,200
Look at you.

204
00:12:03,280 --> 00:12:04,560
You're practicing

205
00:12:05,480 --> 00:12:06,600
basic German.

206
00:12:06,680 --> 00:12:09,840
Last time, you told me
the program was called

207
00:12:09,920 --> 00:12:13,760
the Sino-German
Joint Master's Program, right?

208
00:12:13,840 --> 00:12:17,320
Have the results of
the program's assessment come out yet?

209
00:12:17,400 --> 00:12:18,680
Yes. I passed.

210
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:22,400
But the corporate sponsorship
I applied for hasn't been approved yet,

211
00:12:22,480 --> 00:12:25,240
so I haven't told anyone about it yet.

212
00:12:26,480 --> 00:12:27,800
Corporate sponsorship…

213
00:12:27,880 --> 00:12:29,440
Is that from NingSheng BioTech?

214
00:12:30,400 --> 00:12:33,120
That female boss
you told me about last time…

215
00:12:33,200 --> 00:12:34,920
I looked her up online.

216
00:12:36,080 --> 00:12:37,920
She's really impressive.

217
00:12:38,000 --> 00:12:41,280
I saw that all the people she sponsors
are young women.

218
00:12:42,320 --> 00:12:44,720
Young women these days
are really something.

219
00:12:44,800 --> 00:12:46,880
Back in our day, to be honest,

220
00:12:46,960 --> 00:12:49,360
we barely had the chance
to get an education,

221
00:12:49,440 --> 00:12:52,840
let alone help someone else get one.

222
00:12:52,920 --> 00:12:56,480
Thank goodness my mom encouraged me
to learn a few extra things.

223
00:12:56,560 --> 00:12:59,240
Otherwise, I'd be illiterate today.

224
00:13:00,400 --> 00:13:02,480
Seeing you get this opportunity,

225
00:13:02,560 --> 00:13:04,040
I'm genuinely happy for you.

226
00:13:04,120 --> 00:13:06,160
I'm thrilled!

227
00:13:06,240 --> 00:13:07,080
Thank you.

228
00:13:08,880 --> 00:13:10,440
I read online that

229
00:13:11,440 --> 00:13:14,640
sponsorship for studying abroad
requires signing a contract?

230
00:13:14,720 --> 00:13:15,880
Yes.

231
00:13:15,960 --> 00:13:18,640
I'd have to sign a training
and service commitment agreement.

232
00:13:18,720 --> 00:13:21,520
After graduating and returning to China,
I'd have to work for their company.

233
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:24,960
If I didn't complete the required service
period, I'd be in breach of contract.

234
00:13:25,640 --> 00:13:27,120
That's complicated.

235
00:13:27,200 --> 00:13:30,640
Doesn't that mean you're committing to
your future career now?

236
00:13:31,320 --> 00:13:34,160
- Aren't you worried you'll regret it?
- No.

237
00:13:34,240 --> 00:13:35,800
I've visited the company,

238
00:13:35,880 --> 00:13:38,720
and I've seen how
the employees work there.

239
00:13:38,800 --> 00:13:40,360
For me,

240
00:13:40,440 --> 00:13:44,480
the reason I'm working hard is to build
exactly this kind of stable life.

241
00:13:45,280 --> 00:13:47,720
Besides, this company
has a great reputation in Qingyi.

242
00:13:48,320 --> 00:13:51,120
All right. As long as you know
what you're doing.

243
00:13:52,040 --> 00:13:54,080
Have you told Xiaochen about this?

244
00:13:55,040 --> 00:13:55,880
Not yet.

245
00:13:55,960 --> 00:13:59,720
I plan to wait until the sponsorship gets
officially approved before telling him.

246
00:14:00,840 --> 00:14:01,720
Oh, you.

247
00:14:01,800 --> 00:14:05,320
You always wait until everything is
settled before saying anything.

248
00:14:07,480 --> 00:14:09,080
And yet, you always see right through me.

249
00:14:11,920 --> 00:14:15,000
Still, I think Xiaochen is a good person.

250
00:14:15,840 --> 00:14:17,760
He's worth keeping in your heart.

251
00:14:19,040 --> 00:14:23,240
I support you in going out
to see the wider world.

252
00:14:24,240 --> 00:14:25,640
But remember,

253
00:14:25,720 --> 00:14:28,880
you must always be your own anchor.

254
00:14:32,640 --> 00:14:34,040
Take this.

255
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:37,520
Consider it a gift from me.

256
00:14:38,160 --> 00:14:39,240
You don't have to.

257
00:14:39,320 --> 00:14:41,880
It's just a small token.
Just take it.

258
00:14:43,080 --> 00:14:44,800
As the old saying goes,

259
00:14:44,880 --> 00:14:46,280
save at home, splurge on the road.

260
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:49,800
When you're away from home, it's hard
to feel secure with empty pockets.

261
00:14:51,080 --> 00:14:52,040
Take it.

262
00:14:55,080 --> 00:14:55,920
Thank you.

263
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:58,480
What are you thanking me for?

264
00:14:59,720 --> 00:15:00,760
That's wonderful.

265
00:15:08,280 --> 00:15:10,920
- Is your defense over?
- Yes, it's over.

266
00:15:11,520 --> 00:15:13,840
Hopefully, there won't be
a second defense, right?

267
00:15:14,680 --> 00:15:15,640
Song Mo,

268
00:15:15,720 --> 00:15:18,400
could you at least
wish your girlfriend well?

269
00:15:18,480 --> 00:15:21,720
No, what I mean is,
it's fine even if you have to do it again.

270
00:15:21,800 --> 00:15:24,640
If your graduation gets delayed, I can
apply for grad school at Qing Yi.

271
00:15:25,360 --> 00:15:27,440
Then you'll even have to
call me your senior.

272
00:15:27,520 --> 00:15:29,200
Either way, I come out ahead!

273
00:15:29,280 --> 00:15:33,520
If Zheng Yu hadn't asked me to invite you
to thank you for helping out recently,

274
00:15:33,600 --> 00:15:35,320
you wouldn't even be
sitting at this table.

275
00:15:35,400 --> 00:15:37,640
- How dare you run your mouth like that?
- No…

276
00:15:37,720 --> 00:15:40,200
- You're full of it!
- I…

277
00:15:40,280 --> 00:15:41,400
I surrender!

278
00:15:41,480 --> 00:15:42,920
Surrendering won't save you!

279
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:45,800
- Go easy on him, Fangli.
- Give him a break!

280
00:15:45,880 --> 00:15:47,120
Cheers!

281
00:15:47,200 --> 00:15:50,280
- Happy graduation!
- Happy graduation!

282
00:15:54,480 --> 00:15:56,800
We're moving out of the dorms this week.

283
00:15:56,880 --> 00:15:59,160
Now that I think about it,
I'm a little sad to leave.

284
00:15:59,840 --> 00:16:01,800
When are you all planning to move?
I can come help.

285
00:16:02,440 --> 00:16:04,120
Don't worry. We'll definitely need you.

286
00:16:04,880 --> 00:16:08,000
Just to be clear, I don't need help.
I'm just moving down the hall.

287
00:16:08,080 --> 00:16:11,400
Come on! Your grad school dorm
is still a bit far from our place.

288
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:14,360
Free labor!

289
00:16:14,880 --> 00:16:18,360
What about you? Are you planning to stay
at the company where you interned?

290
00:16:19,400 --> 00:16:23,200
My colleagues are all pretty nice,
and my boss is great too.

291
00:16:23,800 --> 00:16:26,720
Once I get my degree,
they'll convert me to full-time.

292
00:16:28,920 --> 00:16:31,360
I'd like to work full-time for a while
and see how it goes.

293
00:16:32,800 --> 00:16:34,520
Then you need
to find a place to rent, right?

294
00:16:35,120 --> 00:16:36,880
I've already contacted a few agents.

295
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:38,680
I'll look into some places
in the next few days.

296
00:16:39,400 --> 00:16:41,320
Make sure to call us
when you go house hunting.

297
00:16:41,400 --> 00:16:44,440
I've seen so many posts about fresh grads
getting scammed when renting.

298
00:16:45,520 --> 00:16:47,800
If you run out of time,
just leave your stuff in my room first.

299
00:16:47,880 --> 00:16:49,360
I'll hold on to it for you.

300
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:52,240
Aw, thank you, Linlin.

301
00:16:52,320 --> 00:16:55,480
THE NINGSHENG BIOTECH SPONSORSHIP
HAS BEEN APPROVED.

302
00:16:59,360 --> 00:17:02,080
Zheng Yu, how's everything going
with your application to study abroad?

303
00:17:04,040 --> 00:17:05,359
Zheng Yu.

304
00:17:05,440 --> 00:17:06,319
Zheng Yu?

305
00:17:06,400 --> 00:17:07,319
Zheng Yu.

306
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:10,480
I… I need to send an email.

307
00:17:10,560 --> 00:17:12,680
Wait, no. I need to make a call.

308
00:17:12,760 --> 00:17:13,880
Take it easy.

309
00:17:24,400 --> 00:17:25,599
CHEN YANZHOU

310
00:17:29,320 --> 00:17:30,240
<i>Hello?</i>

311
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:33,560
Hello.

312
00:17:34,840 --> 00:17:35,920
Chen Yanzhou.

313
00:17:36,760 --> 00:17:40,160
Remember how you asked me
if I had any plans?

314
00:17:44,320 --> 00:17:45,720
I…

315
00:17:47,760 --> 00:17:49,520
I'm going to study in Germany.

316
00:18:11,520 --> 00:18:12,680
BERLIN BRANDENBURG AIRPORT

317
00:18:12,760 --> 00:18:14,960
FIVE MONTHS LATER

318
00:18:51,520 --> 00:18:52,480
It's been a while.

319
00:18:53,920 --> 00:18:54,840
It's been a while.

320
00:18:57,120 --> 00:18:58,000
Let me take these.

321
00:18:59,240 --> 00:19:00,440
Thank you.

322
00:19:01,840 --> 00:19:02,680
And your bag?

323
00:19:03,600 --> 00:19:04,480
It's fine.

324
00:19:04,560 --> 00:19:06,480
It's really light. I can manage.

325
00:19:08,720 --> 00:19:09,880
Let's go.

326
00:19:22,680 --> 00:19:25,080
Your hair seems to have grown longer.

327
00:19:26,280 --> 00:19:27,280
I haven't cut it.

328
00:19:28,240 --> 00:19:29,920
It looks good on you.

329
00:19:32,680 --> 00:19:35,520
You, on the other hand,
haven't changed much.

330
00:19:37,400 --> 00:19:40,240
I was afraid someone
wouldn't recognize me,

331
00:19:40,320 --> 00:19:42,280
so I tried to look the same.

332
00:19:43,080 --> 00:19:44,800
Are you kidding?

333
00:19:44,880 --> 00:19:47,120
The moment I came out,
I spotted you right away.

334
00:20:09,920 --> 00:20:11,840
So this is the apartment you applied for.

335
00:20:13,080 --> 00:20:14,720
I applied a long time ago.

336
00:20:14,800 --> 00:20:15,920
Luckily,

337
00:20:16,000 --> 00:20:18,080
I got a spot
in this triple room last week.

338
00:20:18,160 --> 00:20:21,360
Even though the room is a bit small
and we share a bathroom,

339
00:20:21,440 --> 00:20:23,920
the rent is cheap,
and the common area is quite spacious.

340
00:20:25,080 --> 00:20:25,960
It's pretty nice here.

341
00:20:27,520 --> 00:20:29,000
You can just put my stuff here.

342
00:20:30,200 --> 00:20:31,360
Let me carry it into your room.

343
00:20:32,680 --> 00:20:33,600
Over there.

344
00:20:41,120 --> 00:20:43,160
I'll leave your things here for now.

345
00:20:43,240 --> 00:20:45,240
Is there anything else you need me to do?

346
00:20:45,960 --> 00:20:47,000
That's all.

347
00:20:47,080 --> 00:20:48,240
You must be tired from driving.

348
00:20:48,320 --> 00:20:50,000
Go back early and get some rest.

349
00:20:50,080 --> 00:20:50,920
All right.

350
00:20:51,000 --> 00:20:53,000
Get some rest too
and adjust to the time difference.

351
00:20:55,320 --> 00:20:57,080
What are your plans for tomorrow?

352
00:20:57,160 --> 00:20:59,400
It's your first day in Berlin.
Do you want to look around?

353
00:21:00,440 --> 00:21:01,800
That's what I had in mind.

354
00:21:02,680 --> 00:21:04,520
Let me know when you're doing that, then.

355
00:21:06,800 --> 00:21:07,640
What?

356
00:21:07,720 --> 00:21:10,720
Could it be that you've made plans
with a tour guide who's not me?

357
00:21:11,800 --> 00:21:13,200
No, of course not.

358
00:21:14,040 --> 00:21:15,760
- Then…
- Hi!

359
00:21:33,480 --> 00:21:35,400
Your housemate is back.

360
00:21:36,080 --> 00:21:37,280
I should get going.

361
00:21:39,560 --> 00:21:40,640
See you tomorrow.

362
00:21:40,720 --> 00:21:41,760
See you tomorrow.

363
00:22:48,360 --> 00:22:53,080
PLAN FOR TOMORROW'S
LEISURELY WANDERING

364
00:22:53,160 --> 00:22:54,680
CHEN YANZHOU

365
00:22:54,760 --> 00:22:58,000
<i>"Wandering" and "having a plan"</i>

366
00:22:58,080 --> 00:23:00,200
<i>don't really go together, do they?</i>

367
00:23:00,280 --> 00:23:03,280
CHEN YANZHOU

368
00:23:04,760 --> 00:23:05,600
Hello.

369
00:23:05,680 --> 00:23:08,600
<i>Actually, Berlin's streets are beautiful</i>
<i>even if you just wander around.</i>

370
00:23:08,680 --> 00:23:10,280
Then why make a plan?

371
00:23:10,360 --> 00:23:14,120
<i>I just didn't know if there were any spots</i>
<i>you'd be interested in,</i>

372
00:23:14,200 --> 00:23:16,320
<i>so I wanted to be prepared.</i>

373
00:23:16,400 --> 00:23:17,720
Did you just get home?

374
00:23:18,960 --> 00:23:20,480
I just got home.

375
00:23:20,560 --> 00:23:22,120
<i>Then take a little break.</i>

376
00:23:22,200 --> 00:23:23,880
<i>You've been driving for so long.</i>

377
00:23:23,960 --> 00:23:25,880
<i>Lie down on the couch for a bit.</i>

378
00:23:27,800 --> 00:23:30,280
Listening to you talk
is just as restful for me.

379
00:23:41,280 --> 00:23:42,240
What's wrong?

380
00:23:43,040 --> 00:23:44,360
<i>Cat got your tongue?</i>

381
00:23:47,200 --> 00:23:48,960
I was just thinking,

382
00:23:49,040 --> 00:23:50,840
you really go all out.

383
00:23:51,520 --> 00:23:54,440
<i>You're so busy at the lab, yet you still</i>
<i>try to be the perfect tour guide.</i>

384
00:23:55,640 --> 00:23:59,360
It's not that bad. After all,
you're the only guest I'm hosting.

385
00:24:00,800 --> 00:24:02,360
After being my tour guide,

386
00:24:02,440 --> 00:24:06,280
you might discover you have a real talent
for the tourism industry.

387
00:24:06,360 --> 00:24:07,840
You could even earn extra money.

388
00:24:09,000 --> 00:24:10,160
That's not where my heart lies.

389
00:24:11,480 --> 00:24:12,680
Then

390
00:24:12,760 --> 00:24:14,200
where does it lie?

391
00:24:15,440 --> 00:24:16,800
You already know.

392
00:24:19,680 --> 00:24:22,360
All right, I'll let you get some rest.

393
00:24:25,720 --> 00:24:27,240
Well…

394
00:24:27,320 --> 00:24:28,480
See you tomorrow then.

395
00:24:29,360 --> 00:24:30,360
See you tomorrow.

396
00:24:31,960 --> 00:24:33,200
Good night.

397
00:24:34,880 --> 00:24:35,880
Good night.

398
00:25:03,160 --> 00:25:05,840
Actually, this is our first stop today.

399
00:25:05,920 --> 00:25:06,760
Here?

400
00:25:06,840 --> 00:25:09,600
You mean
the subway station?

401
00:25:10,200 --> 00:25:11,680
A lot of people
visiting Berlin

402
00:25:11,760 --> 00:25:13,360
come here
to take photos.

403
00:25:13,440 --> 00:25:16,680
ALEXANDERPLATZ STATION

404
00:26:10,720 --> 00:26:13,200
SOFT-SERVE ICE CREAM

405
00:26:13,280 --> 00:26:14,160
What's going on?

406
00:26:14,240 --> 00:26:15,840
Why are you suddenly video calling me?

407
00:26:16,440 --> 00:26:18,480
You went radio silent
after landing in Germany.

408
00:26:18,560 --> 00:26:19,680
I just wanted to check on you.

409
00:26:21,080 --> 00:26:24,840
I bet Zhuang Ning and Linlin are too busy
and you're bored all alone.

410
00:26:25,960 --> 00:26:27,040
You caught me.

411
00:26:28,760 --> 00:26:30,160
Are you outside right now?

412
00:26:32,480 --> 00:26:33,440
<i>Just walking around.</i>

413
00:26:33,520 --> 00:26:34,840
Pan the camera around.

414
00:26:34,920 --> 00:26:36,040
Let me see this great Berlin.

415
00:26:46,200 --> 00:26:47,080
<i>Wait a second.</i>

416
00:26:48,200 --> 00:26:49,200
Turn back a little.

417
00:26:50,080 --> 00:26:51,000
<i>A little more.</i>

418
00:26:52,480 --> 00:26:55,200
I knew it! You went sightseeing,

419
00:26:55,280 --> 00:26:56,600
<i>but you didn't post any photos.</i>

420
00:26:56,680 --> 00:26:59,240
<i>Turns out you're with Chen Yanzhou,</i>
<i>so you were too busy to post!</i>

421
00:27:00,080 --> 00:27:01,040
Are you two together now?

422
00:27:02,800 --> 00:27:03,680
No.

423
00:27:03,760 --> 00:27:06,360
<i>You've been in Berlin for more than…</i>

424
00:27:06,440 --> 00:27:09,640
More than 24 hours now,
and you're still not together?

425
00:27:09,720 --> 00:27:10,960
<i>This is killing me!</i>

426
00:27:11,040 --> 00:27:12,760
<i>Have you asked him yet?</i>

427
00:27:14,160 --> 00:27:15,440
I…

428
00:27:15,520 --> 00:27:16,760
How would I ask?

429
00:27:17,280 --> 00:27:18,400
<i>You can test the waters!</i>

430
00:27:18,480 --> 00:27:21,600
Just spend time together
as friends for now.

431
00:27:21,680 --> 00:27:24,880
If he likes you, he definitely
won't want to stay just friends.

432
00:27:45,040 --> 00:27:47,920
Is this place somewhere you come often?

433
00:27:50,200 --> 00:27:52,600
Sometimes, I come here to sit by myself.

434
00:27:52,680 --> 00:27:53,880
Thinking about…

435
00:27:55,240 --> 00:27:56,480
About what?

436
00:27:58,960 --> 00:28:00,320
That

437
00:28:00,920 --> 00:28:03,840
it's such a waste to enjoy
such beautiful scenery alone.

438
00:28:05,160 --> 00:28:06,120
A waste?

439
00:28:08,240 --> 00:28:10,360
Watching such a beautiful sunset alone

440
00:28:10,440 --> 00:28:13,680
is like going to a buffet
and only getting a plate of salad.

441
00:28:15,560 --> 00:28:17,040
But it'll be better from now on.

442
00:28:17,840 --> 00:28:19,200
We can take our time and enjoy it.

443
00:28:22,560 --> 00:28:26,880
Then from now on, if you ever feel lonely
and want to go somewhere to relax,

444
00:28:26,960 --> 00:28:28,040
just come find me.

445
00:28:28,120 --> 00:28:28,960
I'll be here.

446
00:28:30,200 --> 00:28:31,520
Really?

447
00:28:32,080 --> 00:28:34,320
<i>Just spend time together</i>
<i>as friends for now.</i>

448
00:28:34,400 --> 00:28:37,160
<i>If he likes you, he definitely</i>
<i>won't want to stay just friends.</i>

449
00:28:39,160 --> 00:28:42,640
After all, I don't really
know anyone else here.

450
00:28:52,760 --> 00:28:53,920
No problem.

451
00:28:58,360 --> 00:29:02,000
Thanks for taking me
to so many great places today.

452
00:29:03,640 --> 00:29:05,200
You're thanking me too soon.

453
00:29:05,280 --> 00:29:07,600
There are still so many places
we haven't been to yet.

454
00:29:50,320 --> 00:29:52,000
<i>How's it going?</i>

455
00:29:52,080 --> 00:29:53,560
XU FANGLI

456
00:29:53,640 --> 00:29:56,320
<i>I tested the waters last time</i>
<i>and there wasn't much reaction.</i>

457
00:29:56,400 --> 00:29:59,040
<i>I've been busy these past few days,</i>
<i>so we haven't seen each other much.</i>

458
00:30:01,160 --> 00:30:02,800
<i>Keep probing and report back!</i>

459
00:30:06,320 --> 00:30:09,720
NEW MESSAGE: CHEN YANZHOU

460
00:30:09,800 --> 00:30:11,280
<i>Are you still in class?</i>

461
00:30:14,240 --> 00:30:15,840
<i>Classes are over.</i>

462
00:30:19,120 --> 00:30:21,240
<i>What are you doing later?</i>

463
00:30:24,560 --> 00:30:25,640
<i>Studying.</i>

464
00:30:28,560 --> 00:30:29,560
<i>What about you?</i>

465
00:31:21,440 --> 00:31:22,800
<i>I'm planning to study too.</i>

466
00:31:28,760 --> 00:31:30,680
ZHENG YU: STUDYING.
WHAT ABOUT YOU?

467
00:31:30,760 --> 00:31:33,400
You traveled an hour all the way over here

468
00:31:33,480 --> 00:31:35,200
just to study at our campus?

469
00:31:35,720 --> 00:31:37,760
And you insisted on dragging me along!

470
00:31:39,320 --> 00:31:41,040
Aren't you going on
a business trip tomorrow?

471
00:31:42,560 --> 00:31:44,080
I'm just helping you graduate sooner.

472
00:31:45,800 --> 00:31:46,640
Thanks a lot.

473
00:31:48,640 --> 00:31:51,520
Besides, at your university,
you're the only…

474
00:31:53,160 --> 00:31:55,080
No, you're one of
the only two people I know.

475
00:31:55,600 --> 00:31:57,240
It's not like I had any other options.

476
00:31:58,000 --> 00:31:59,120
Two?

477
00:32:00,400 --> 00:32:02,840
Look at you! When did you meet
someone new behind my back?

478
00:32:08,200 --> 00:32:10,800
You're distracted.
You're not really here to see me, are you?

479
00:32:13,520 --> 00:32:15,840
I told you, I'm here to study with you.

480
00:32:16,960 --> 00:32:18,280
Total nonsense.

481
00:32:18,360 --> 00:32:20,960
Whatever your reason is, can we eat first?

482
00:32:23,320 --> 00:32:24,360
Fine.

483
00:32:26,560 --> 00:32:28,160
ZHENG YU

484
00:32:28,240 --> 00:32:29,840
<i>Have you eaten yet?</i>

485
00:32:38,800 --> 00:32:40,200
You still haven't answered me.

486
00:32:40,280 --> 00:32:42,800
When did you meet this new person
from our university?

487
00:32:43,800 --> 00:32:45,760
It's not someone new. It's an old friend.

488
00:32:46,960 --> 00:32:47,840
An old friend?

489
00:32:52,360 --> 00:32:54,200
So you had an ulterior motive all along.

490
00:32:54,280 --> 00:32:57,920
Since you're old friends,
why use studying as an excuse?

491
00:32:58,000 --> 00:32:59,080
Why not just go see her?

492
00:33:01,240 --> 00:33:03,400
I came here
without telling her beforehand.

493
00:33:04,000 --> 00:33:07,600
If I suddenly tell her I'm nearby
and ask to see her,

494
00:33:07,680 --> 00:33:10,040
wouldn't that put
a lot of pressure on her?

495
00:33:13,800 --> 00:33:14,720
Oh, Chen Yanzhou.

496
00:33:14,800 --> 00:33:18,280
I really never expected you'd be like this
when falling in love.

497
00:33:18,360 --> 00:33:20,040
- Like what?
- One word.

498
00:33:21,240 --> 00:33:22,640
Cowardly.

499
00:33:24,200 --> 00:33:25,320
You wouldn't understand.

500
00:33:25,400 --> 00:33:28,000
I don't get you.
What's there to be afraid of?

501
00:33:28,080 --> 00:33:29,560
Did she reject you before?

502
00:33:34,360 --> 00:33:36,360
No way. She really did?

503
00:33:38,960 --> 00:33:40,560
I confessed my feelings to her in China.

504
00:33:40,640 --> 00:33:43,280
Basically, she felt pressured by it.

505
00:33:43,360 --> 00:33:44,960
So I'm not really sure

506
00:33:45,800 --> 00:33:47,120
where to draw the line anymore.

507
00:33:48,080 --> 00:33:52,440
Then you need to communicate more
to figure out where her boundaries are.

508
00:33:52,520 --> 00:33:54,360
Listen to me. Ask her out now.

509
00:33:55,600 --> 00:33:57,400
No. I already asked her.

510
00:33:57,480 --> 00:33:58,680
She's studying tonight.

511
00:33:58,760 --> 00:34:02,280
She's not like you, making travel plans
halfway through studying,

512
00:34:02,360 --> 00:34:03,840
playing video games during class,

513
00:34:03,920 --> 00:34:06,120
and grabbing a drink
before heading to the library.

514
00:34:06,200 --> 00:34:07,160
She's different.

515
00:34:07,240 --> 00:34:08,080
Hey, you…

516
00:34:26,360 --> 00:34:28,560
Hi. I'm Lai Wendong.

517
00:34:28,639 --> 00:34:30,480
You can call me Leon, like everyone else.

518
00:34:30,560 --> 00:34:33,000
I'm in biology too, a year ahead of you.

519
00:34:33,080 --> 00:34:35,600
Let's chat more and exchange ideas
in the future.

520
00:34:36,600 --> 00:34:38,360
- Cheers to you.
- Cheers.

521
00:34:45,920 --> 00:34:48,320
If she's studying,
just ask her another time.

522
00:34:48,400 --> 00:34:49,800
There's no need to drown your sorrows.

523
00:34:53,520 --> 00:34:54,840
The same.

524
00:34:54,920 --> 00:34:55,800
Make it two.

525
00:35:03,880 --> 00:35:04,960
You…

526
00:35:08,560 --> 00:35:10,160
That girl's Chinese, right?

527
00:35:12,880 --> 00:35:13,920
And she's pretty cute.

528
00:35:14,840 --> 00:35:16,720
But you don't need
to keep staring at her like that.

529
00:35:29,360 --> 00:35:30,680
She's the second person?

530
00:36:06,400 --> 00:36:08,480
<i>Meet me at the entrance when you're done.</i>

531
00:36:08,560 --> 00:36:09,600
<i>I need to talk to you.</i>

532
00:36:22,360 --> 00:36:23,560
Chen Yanzhou.

533
00:36:31,320 --> 00:36:32,680
Are you

534
00:36:33,280 --> 00:36:34,400
drunk?

535
00:36:39,400 --> 00:36:40,760
Liar.

536
00:36:40,840 --> 00:36:43,200
You were texting me just a moment ago.

537
00:36:46,520 --> 00:36:48,200
This drink has a strong delayed kick.

538
00:36:49,280 --> 00:36:50,320
I had a lot just now.

539
00:36:51,680 --> 00:36:53,200
Why did you drink so much?

540
00:36:57,680 --> 00:36:58,840
Because you lied to me.

541
00:37:01,720 --> 00:37:03,400
You were clearly at a gathering,

542
00:37:04,160 --> 00:37:06,840
yet you lied and said you were studying.

543
00:37:09,600 --> 00:37:11,720
I really was studying.

544
00:37:11,800 --> 00:37:13,600
I was practicing my conversation skills.

545
00:37:13,680 --> 00:37:16,600
What about you?
Didn't you say you were studying?

546
00:37:17,400 --> 00:37:18,720
I was afraid of disturbing you,

547
00:37:18,800 --> 00:37:20,000
so I didn't even dare text you.

548
00:37:20,600 --> 00:37:21,600
I…

549
00:37:24,560 --> 00:37:25,480
I was studying.

550
00:37:26,640 --> 00:37:28,200
I was learning from you.

551
00:37:28,840 --> 00:37:29,840
You went to a gathering,

552
00:37:30,640 --> 00:37:31,680
so I went to one too.

553
00:37:36,160 --> 00:37:37,520
You

554
00:37:37,600 --> 00:37:38,480
can't smile.

555
00:37:39,760 --> 00:37:41,040
Why not?

556
00:37:42,520 --> 00:37:44,440
Because whenever I see you smile,

557
00:37:45,920 --> 00:37:47,680
I end up forgiving you for everything.

558
00:37:54,880 --> 00:37:55,720
I…

559
00:37:56,320 --> 00:37:58,880
Actually, I was going
to the library today.

560
00:37:59,880 --> 00:38:01,720
My housemate, Lena,

561
00:38:01,800 --> 00:38:03,280
invited me to the gathering.

562
00:38:03,360 --> 00:38:06,600
She's really nice, so I said yes.

563
00:38:10,040 --> 00:38:10,880
Me too.

564
00:38:11,840 --> 00:38:12,960
I…

565
00:38:13,680 --> 00:38:16,320
was going to the library
hoping to run into you.

566
00:38:17,000 --> 00:38:18,080
But then

567
00:38:19,000 --> 00:38:20,640
Qin Shizi dragged me out to eat.

568
00:38:23,920 --> 00:38:25,000
Okay.

569
00:38:25,080 --> 00:38:27,760
Now that the misunderstanding
is cleared up,

570
00:38:27,840 --> 00:38:29,440
let's go.

571
00:38:38,200 --> 00:38:39,040
I…

572
00:38:40,520 --> 00:38:41,880
can't walk anymore.

573
00:38:45,960 --> 00:38:46,960
Chen Yanzhou.

574
00:38:47,600 --> 00:38:48,760
Are you

575
00:38:49,320 --> 00:38:50,760
trying to act cute?

576
00:38:52,000 --> 00:38:53,040
Stop pretending.

577
00:38:53,120 --> 00:38:54,440
I know you can walk.

578
00:38:59,040 --> 00:39:01,040
I'm not the only one who gets drunk.

579
00:39:01,840 --> 00:39:04,200
Why does someone else
get to act completely spoiled,

580
00:39:04,280 --> 00:39:06,040
while I get this kind of treatment?

581
00:39:07,160 --> 00:39:09,400
You really hold a grudge, don't you?

582
00:39:11,080 --> 00:39:12,360
Didn't I tell you?

583
00:39:13,200 --> 00:39:14,160
You

584
00:39:15,120 --> 00:39:16,320
can't smile.

585
00:39:18,000 --> 00:39:19,200
I'm going to smile anyway.

586
00:39:19,920 --> 00:39:21,360
What are you going to do about it?

587
00:39:33,840 --> 00:39:36,360
How about I help you walk?

588
00:40:03,840 --> 00:40:04,760
Chen Yanzhou.

589
00:40:05,600 --> 00:40:08,800
Some things should wait
until you're sober.

590
00:40:12,920 --> 00:40:15,240
You've had too much to drink.
Let me take you home.

591
00:40:28,680 --> 00:40:29,680
The keys?

592
00:40:52,960 --> 00:40:54,000
This way.

593
00:40:57,240 --> 00:40:58,200
Be careful.

594
00:41:02,640 --> 00:41:03,840
Come on, sit down.

595
00:41:41,200 --> 00:41:42,360
Chen Yanzhou.

596
00:41:42,960 --> 00:41:44,320
Actually,

597
00:41:45,000 --> 00:41:48,120
there's something I've been wanting
to ask you these past few days.

598
00:41:49,440 --> 00:41:50,680
You…

599
00:44:33,160 --> 00:44:38,160
Subtitle translation by: Cempaka Malinja
